                  "description": {
                    "value": "Bolstered by magical power, the target grows to size Large.\n\nIts equipment grows with it but returns to natural size if removed. The creature is clumsy 1. Its reach increases by 5 feet (or by 10 feet if it started out Tiny), and it gains a +2 status bonus to melee damage. This spell has no effect on a Large or larger creature."
                  },
                  "higher_level_description": {
                    "value": "Heightened (4th): The creature instead grows to size Huge. The status bonus to melee damage is +4 and the creature's reach increases by 10 feet (or 15 feet if the creature started out Tiny). The spell has no effect on a Huge or larger creature.\n\nHeightened (6th): Choose either the 2nd-level or 4th-level version of this spell and apply its effects to 10 willing creatures."
                  },
